    {
      "id": "quiz-0",
      "type": "singleChoice",
      "question": "A seek 後，B 把檔案寫長，A 的獨立 offset 會？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "option-0",
          "text": "自動跟著 EOF 變大"
        },
        {
          "id": "option-1",
          "text": "保留 seek 當時的位置"
        },
        {
          "id": "option-2",
          "text": "自動加鎖"
        }
      ],
      "answerId": "option-1",
      "explanation": "普通的 lseek 只是把當下算出的數字存進 A 的 entry，沒有綁定未來 EOF。",
      "revisit": "offset-size"
    }
